# Local environment. The Imgur Client-ID inside is a public identifier rather
# than a secret, so this is tidiness and not a security boundary. It is here
# because .env.example tells you to copy it to .env.local, and a file created
# by following the instructions should not then show up in git status.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

